#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""
RAICA - RAG AI Coding Agent
============================

Intelligent coding agent that interprets user intent from context.

Usage:
    raica -p "your request here"           # LLM interprets: fix, enhance, or create
    raica -d ./project -p "add dark mode"  # Work in specified project
    raica                                  # Launch interactive TUI

    # The LLM decides what to do based on context:
    raica -p "the Pi key shows undefined"  # → LLM checks if key exists, decides fix/enhance
    raica -p "create a calculator"         # → LLM sees no project, decides create
    raica -p "make it faster"              # → LLM sees project, decides enhance

    # Optional explicit hints (power users):
    raica debug                            # Force debug mode
    raica create "game"                    # Force create mode

Features:
    - LLM-driven intent interpretation (no rigid categorization required)
    - Iterative context gathering before action
    - Unified handling of fix/enhance/create
    - Interactive terminal UI for complex workflows
    - Session persistence and resumption
    - Automated testing and verification

Author: RAICA Project
Version: 2.3.0
"""

